flowchart TB
  I[GitHub Issue] --> U[Understand]
  U --> X[Explore repo]
  X --> E[Edit / patch]
  E --> V[External verify]
  V -->|fail| S[State + recovery]
  S --> E
  V -->|pass| R[Result + audit]
  R --- P[Permission boundary]
  R --- T[Timeout / retry]
  R --- O[Observability: steps, latency, cost]
  R --- G[Regression eval]

